n287 | # 产品2.0 E2E会话清理SecurityError修复\n288 | 产品2.0 项目修复 E2E 用例因 about:blank 页清理 localStorage 触发 SecurityError 导致「待提交完即审核中」的问题。\n289 | \n290 | ## 问题现象\n291 | - 03 用例开始时 page 仍为 about:blank，直接 page.evaluate 清理 localStorage 会抛出 SecurityError。\n292 | - 根因位于 clearBrowserSession，导致用例状态异常（没有待确认，待提交完即审核中）。\n293 | \n294 | ## 修改内容\n295 | - e2e/fixtures/auth-helpers.js 的 clearBrowserSession 改为：先 clearCookies，判断当前页协议是否为 http/https。\n296 | - 若当前页不可清理（非 http/https），先 page.goto('/#/') 再清理 localStorage。\n297 | - 增加 try/catch 兜底，避免清理失败中断用例。\n298 | \n299 | ## 验证与归属\n300 | - 验证证据：extracted source=cursor project=产品2.0\n301 | - 涉及文件：e2e/fixtures/auth-helpers.js、e2e/company/company-record-change.spec.js、CompanyBasicInfoDetail.vue。\n302 | - 所属项目：产品2.0；来源会话：c24a0b77-252c-498f-8424-de964da60242；代码基线：none。\n303 | \n304 | ===== 16 sha=9ad4256e899fdd11\n305 | URI: viking://user/default/memories/entities/技术模式/lease_filing_handlepick_extra.md\n306 | # B端租赁备案选区域 handlePick 扩展\n307 | 园区物管2.0 中资源租赁合同备案 detail 选择「物业管理区域名称」弹窗，需对齐资产租赁备案同场景增加 extra 与 extraLinks。\n308 | \n309 | ## 背景\n310 | - 资源租赁合同备案 detail 选择「物业管理区域名称」弹窗应参考 assetsLeaseContractFiling/detail.vue 实现\n311 | \n312 |\n\n[...]\n\n424 | `PageButton.vue` 未设 `box-sizing: border-box` 且 `min-height` 未含安全区致各记录页底部灰边。\n425 | ## 问题根因\n426 | - `PageButton.vue` 缺少 `box-sizing: border-box`，`min-height` 未包含 `safe-area-inset-bottom`。\n427 | - 各记录页 `padding-bottom` 固化，导致底部出现灰边。\n428 | ## 解决方案\n429 | - `PageButton.vue` 增加 `box-sizing: border-box` 与 `min-height: calc(136rpx + safe-area-inset-bottom)` 及 `constant()` 兼容。\n430 | - `uni.scss` 新增 `--page-button-area-height` 变量，`record/index.vue` 与 `record/add.vue` 等 `padding-bottom` 改为该变量。\n431 | ## 验证与归属\n432 | - 所属项目：物业手持B端\n433 | - 验证证据：extracted source=cursor project=物业手持B端\n434 | - 验证证据：src=物业手持B端/002.md\n435 | - 涉及文件：src/components/PageButton/PageButton.vue、src/pages_facility/record/add.vue、src/pages_facility/record/index.vue、src/pages_facility/record/addScrap.vue、src/pages_facility/issue/detail.vue、src/pages/cashier/index.vue、src/App.vue、src/pages_facility/repair/submit.vue\n436 | - 来源会话ID：5f92693a-f239-424f-9269-4366a09e5165\n437 | - 代码基线：none\n438 | \n439 | ===== 23 sha=2f5415a679ee033b\n440 | URI: viking://user/default/memories/entities/su_housing_c_tech/message_list_layout_fix.md\n441 | # Message List Item Layout Misalignment Fix\n442 | In Su Zhu Fang C (zhi2-mobile-shimin), the message list item originally placed icon, title, and tag on the same row with summary on a separate line, causing summary misalignment and title compression. Fixed by a left bell icon with red dot, right first-row title + tag + time, second-row summary, title font-weight 600.\n443 | \n444 | ## Root Cause\n445 | - message.vue list item originally placed icon, title, and tag on same row with summary on separate line, causing summary misalignment and title compression\n446 | \n447 | ## Solution\n448 | - Adjusted to left bell icon with red dot, right first row title + tag + time, second row summary\n449 | - Title font-weight 600\n450 | - If title does not show, check whether dictionary msg_bus_code_H5 is loaded\n451 | \n452 | ## Involved Files\n453 | - d:/repository/苏住房C/zhi2-mobile-shimin/src/pages_main/message/message.vue\n454 | - d:/repository/苏住房C/zhi2-mobile-shimin/src/pages/message/index.vue\n455 | - d:/repository/苏住房C/zhi2-mobile-shimin/src/pages/message/message.vue\n456 | - d:/repository/苏住房C/zhi2-mobile-shimin/src/pages_my/robot/index.vue\n457 | - d:/repository/苏住房C/zhi2-mobile-shimin/src/api/msg.js\n458 | - d:/repository/苏住房C/zhi2-mobile-shimin/src/pages_main/message/index.vue\n459 | - d:/repository/苏住房C/zhi2-mobile-shimin/src/components/ZsDict/ZsDict.vue\n460 | - d:/repository/苏住房C/zhi2-mobile-shimin/src/components/ZsCheckbox/ZsCheckbox.vue\n461 | \n462 | ## Verification and Attribution\n463 | - Verification evidence: extracted source=cursor session=1b6b9470-2d5b-4ade-a9e6-8d19594ebac4\n464 | - Code baseline: none\n465 | \n[Notice: 208 items displayed; complete=true; TruncatedBy: n