{"id": "msg_07f3a428a462403eb998cacabacb1aca", "role": "user", "parts": [{"type": "tool", "tool_id": "chatcmpl-tool-88c3b791821c35fb", "tool_name": "ops_inspect_local_file", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "completed", "tool_output": "[cwd: resolvedFrom=D:\\repository\\skills; cwdSource=workingDirectory.]\n=== FILE: C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.dsh\\cache\\memory-audit\\digest2.txt (Lines 1-240 of 451) ===\n[Notice: revision=49b09520d41a90670ea013bb8deb2f05fff0b5028f119280c1af51074d63d850; bytes=27523.]\n1 | ===== 24 sha=aa3976b1fa21fd72\n2 | URI: viking://user/default/memories/entities/技术模式/account_tip_style.md\n3 | # 拟开户账户名称提示框样式调整（苏住房G）\n4 | 苏住房G 项目 zhi2-web-admin 调整 benefit/pubRegulatoryAccount/detail.vue 中 `.proposed-account-name-tip` 样式，使 el-alert 提示框仅包住文字与图标。\n5 | \n6 | ## 问题原因\n7 | - `el-alert` 默认占满父容器整行宽度，导致文字左侧一小段、右侧大片蓝色空白\n8 | \n9 | ## 修复样式\n10 | - `display: inline-flex`：按内容收缩布局\n11 | - `width: fit-content`：宽度随文字变化\n12 | - `max-width: 100%`：窄屏时可换行不溢出\n13 | \n14 | ## 涉及文件与归属\n15 | - 涉及文件：src/views/benefit/pubRegulatoryAccount/detail.vue\n16 | - 所属项目：苏住房G（zhi2-web-admin）\n17 | - 来源会话ID：54b4e1e7-1b46-41b8-a497-2f06010c1c68\n18 | \n19 | ## 验证与归属\n20 | - 验证证据：extracted source=cursor project=苏住房G\n21 | \n22 | ===== 25 sha=f0fb5aa3aa5d8e96\n23 | URI: viking://user/default/memories/entities/技术模式/public_portal_detail_grid.md\n24 | # 公开门户二级页详情字段对齐方案\n25 | 公开门户（publicPortal）机构/人员等详情采用四列网格 + display:contents + subgrid 解决标签值错位。\n26 | \n27 | ## 问题根因\n28 | - 混用全宽行与双列行，双列用两个 50% flex 格各自排 label/value，导致左右列值起点不一致、窄列文字叠在标签上\n29 | - 根因是两套标签宽度 + 双列 flex\n30 | \n31 | ## 解决方案\n32 | - 字段区改四列网格：`180px | 值 | 180px | 值`\n33 | - 双列项容器用 `display: contents` 让 dt/dd 直接落入四列成对排列\n34 | - 全宽项占满一行，优先用 `grid-template-columns: subgrid` 与父网格对齐（不支持时回退相同四列定义），值从第 2 列跨到行末，与双列左侧值 x 起点一致\n35 | - 标签列宽度需足够容纳「统一社会信用代码」等长文案避免换行\n36 | - ≤1200px 断点调整时勿把机构详情误收成两列导致再次错位\n37 | \n38 | ## 验证与归属\n39 | - 验证证据：extracted source=cursor project=门户\n40 | - 用户反馈字段对齐出问题后改四列网格，要求刷新验证全宽行与双列左侧值纵向对齐\n41 | - 涉及 zhi2-web-admin/src/views/home/publicPortal/portal.scss、PropertyPages.vue、BrokerPages.vue、PropertyDetailDialog.vue、RentalDetailDialog.vue\n42 | - 所属项目：门户；来源会话 f3136e73-1172-459f-872c-cc4efe5d4b2f；代码基线 e1f8e0b\n43 | \n44 | ===== 26 sha=18fd7891c2a13c10\n45 | URI: viking://user/default/memories/preferences/user/pagination_sync_migration.md\n46 | - Root cause of pagination bounce: `zs-pagination` migrated to `v-model:current-page`, but many pages still use old `:page.sync`/`:limit.sync` syntax, causing pagination to bounce back.\n47 | - Preferred fix: globally regex-replace `:page.sync=` with `v-model:page=`, `:limit.sync=` with `v-model:limit=`, and migrate `zs-select`'s `:value.sync` to `v-model:value` under `zhi2-web-admin/src`.\n48 | - Verification: extracted source=cursor session=73a5ecd2-f9fb-443b-b4b0-8e8521acce74\n49 | - Files: property/complex/index.vue, `@zhi2-web-admin/src/components/zs-pagination/zs-pagination.vue`\n50 | \n51 | ===== 27 sha=11e1221980e1000a\n52 | URI: viking://user/default/memories/entities/technical_pattern/branch_status_dict_mismatch.md\n53 | # Branch Status Dict Mismatch\n54 | Branch_record_state dictionary co\n\n[...]\n\nsertion passed.\n211 | - Remaining steps: select maintenance object rows in the dialog, confirm, assert the radio is available and no 404 dialog appears, capture a full-page screenshot, then put evidence in the session, commit/push, write back to Zentao, and clean artifacts.\n212 | \n213 | ## Maintenance Fund Vote Route Name Defect\n214 | - Root cause: the Huishan site uses route name=`OwnerDecision/owner` for \"Maintenance Fund Vote\"; `$route.name.split('/')[1]=='owner'` is not 'maintain', so 13 checks each in `estate/ownerDecision/index.vue` and `detail.vue` took the OWNERS branch.\n215 | - The same component is reused by routes vote (owners committee election) and supervisory (supervisory committee); commit ae02888b2 had changed owner occurrences in comments to maintain, but the Huishan menu still emitted `OwnerD