{"id": "msg_91cc8cb40de14c2fa249307b936b0caa", "role": "user", "parts": [{"type": "tool", "tool_id": "chatcmpl-tool-9d88b90c027162c3", "tool_name": "ops_inspect_local_file", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "completed", "tool_output": "[cwd: resolvedFrom=D:\\repository\\skills; cwdSource=workingDirectory.]\n=== FILE: C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.dsh\\cache\\memory-audit\\digest2.txt (Lines 52-211 of 451) ===\n[Notice: revision=49b09520d41a90670ea013bb8deb2f05fff0b5028f119280c1af51074d63d850; bytes=27523.]\n52 | URI: viking://user/default/memories/entities/technical_pattern/branch_status_dict_mismatch.md\n53 | # Branch Status Dict Mismatch\n54 | Branch_record_state dictionary conflicted with bizState interface code causing misdisplay of \"已注销\" in Suzhou real estate monitoring V3.\n55 | \n56 | ## Problem\n57 | - branch_record_state dict value 2 means 已注销, but interface bizState value 2 means 已备案\n58 | - Directly querying table caused list to misdisplay \"已注销\"\n59 | \n60 | ## Fix\n61 | - branchStatus.js maps via cancelStatus and bizState dictionary code\n62 | - Added e2e/institution/agency-branch-status.spec.js for validation\n63 | \n64 | ## Verification\n65 | - Evidence: src=苏州市房地产监测V3/024.md\n66 | - Source session: db358c02-d2dc-45a3-b641-20f260d73f4b\n67 | - Files: AgencyPersonnelList.vue, personnelStatus.js, AgencyBranchList.vue, branchStatus.js, AgencyPersonnelDetail.vue, StatusAdjustDialog.vue, InfoCardDialog.vue, zs-table-column.vue\n68 | \n69 | ## 验证与归属\n70 | - 所属项目：苏州市房地产监测V3\n71 | - 验证证据：extracted source=cursor project=苏州市房地产监测V3\n72 | - 来源会话：db358c02-d2dc-45a3-b641-20f260d73f4b\n73 | \n74 | ===== 28 sha=3b0f3f4178d53938\n75 | URI: viking://user/default/memories/entities/苏住房g技术笔记/agreement_dict_fix.md\n76 | # 协议签署单据状态字典错位修复\n77 | 苏住房G协议签署页(pubRegulatoryAgreement)修复initDict中getDicts字典项配置错误导致的「单据状态」查询错位。\n78 | \n79 | ## 问题现象\n80 | - pubRegulatoryAgreement/index.vue中initDict的getDicts字典项配置错误，致「单据状态」查询条件错位\n81 | \n82 | ## 解法要点\n83 | - 修正initDict内get